  <p class="dek">
    A Python framework for writing web applications <em>properly</em>.
  </p>
  <div class="install">
    <div class="install-cmd highlight">
      <span class="prompt">$ </span><code>uvx proper_new myapp</code>
    </div>
    <p class="install-note">
      Type this command, and a new project will appear (<a
        href="https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/"
        target="_blank"
        >requires <em class="mono">uv</em></a
      >)
    </p>
  </div>
